<h2>Asobi 0.2 (build 236)</h2>
<p><b>The overnight watcher asks Kitsu too.</b></p>
<ul>
<li><code>asobi watch --kitsu-project NAME</code> gives the headless 3am watcher the same tracker oracle the app got in build 232: deliveries whose version is already in Kitsu ingest immediately — <code>kitsu-confirmed</code> in the cron log — and land in the morning's session carrying their task, ready to publish back.</li>
<li>Pass <code>KITSU_TOKEN</code> in the job's environment (cron has no keychain); <code>--kitsu-url</code> overrides the app-saved server.</li>
<li>Fixed: the headless watcher's <code>--quiescence</code> flag was parsed but never applied.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
